  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With no mortal heart to guide them, a heartless will often become callous and distant. At 2nd level, the heartless gains a morale bonus equal to 1/2 their heartless level on Will saves against fear and emotion effects. However, the heartless must save against all emotion effects, including harmless or beneficial effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/heartless#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
